usage: selective_fusion_probe.py [-h] --engine ENGINE --tests TESTS
                                 --baseline BASELINE --fused FUSED
                                 --suite SUITE --output OUTPUT
                                 [--prepare-only] [--timeout TIMEOUT]

Future direct-process classical HIP comparison; this file itself is CPU-only.
Run inside an authorized GPU environment with explicit native artifact paths.
It launches no Docker/SSH wrapper and stops on any failure, without replay.

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --engine ENGINE
  --tests TESTS
  --baseline BASELINE
  --fused FUSED
  --suite SUITE
  --output OUTPUT
  --prepare-only       declare/fingerprint without launching
  --timeout TIMEOUT
